From ea69f60fff6bad53adbd43ce13fd10a2b3a31892 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:20:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LEGO City: pause menu fills the window; Y flips to the
 progress board

While the pause menu runs (overrides counter, slot 8) its menu (the
bottom screen) fills the window; Y shows the progress board (the top
screen) instead, where L/R still flip its areas and B comes back. A
button used here is kept from the game until let go.
---
 crates/zakuro/src/lib.rs         | 10 ++++-
 crates/zakuro/src/title_hooks.rs | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 71 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

